        <body>
            <div xml:id="toc">

                <pb facs="0009" n="V" xml:id="pgV"/>

                <head>Contents</head>
                <list type="toc">
                    <item><ref target="#pgIII"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Preface</hi></ref></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Messages of the President of the United States
                            to Congress</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pgIX">Message of December 8, 1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pgXXIII">Message of December 10, 1931</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><ref target="#pgXXXIII"><hi rendition="#small-caps">List of
                            Papers</hi></ref></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">General</hi>: <list>
                            <item>Efforts of the United States to prevent financial collapse in
                                Europe: <list>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg1">I. Proposal by President Hoover for a
                                            moratorium on intergovernmental debts</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg42">II. Negotiations to secure acceptance
                                            by France of the moratorium proposal</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg164">III. The London Conference of
                                            Experts, July 17–August 11, 1931</ref></item>
                                    <item>IV. Attitude of interested governments toward the
                                        moratorium proposal: <list>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg175">Austria</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg175">Belgium</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg189">Bulgaria</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg200">Czechoslovakia</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg202">Egypt</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg203">Finland</ref></item>
                                            <item>France. (See <ref target="#pg42">pages</ref> 42
                                                ff.)</item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg204">Great Britain, the British
                                                  Dominions and India</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg207">Greece</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg217">Hungary</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg219">Italy</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg225">Japan</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg226">Lithuania</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg226">Latvia and
                                                Estonia</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg227">Poland</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg227">Portugal</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg230">Rumania</ref></item>
                                            <item><ref target="#pg230">Yugoslavia</ref></item>
                                        </list></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg240">V. Congressional approval of the
                                            moratorium</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg250">VI. Participation of the United
                                            States in efforts to halt the withdrawals of short-term
                                            credits from Germany</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg332">VII. Meeting of the Young Plan
                                            Advisory Committee, Basel, December 8–23,
                                        1931</ref></item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg358">Negotiations looking toward a solution of the
                                    problem of French and Italian naval construction</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg440">The armaments truce of November 1,
                                1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg471">Preparations for the General Disarmament
                                    Conference</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg536">Visit of the Secretary of State to
                                    Europe</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg565">Interest of the United States in the proposed
                                    Austro-German Customs Union</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg593">Attendance of an unofficial American observer
                                    at meetings of the Conference of Ambassadors</ref></item>
                            <pb facs="0010" n="VI" xml:id="pgVI"/>
                            <item><ref target="#pg595">Tension arising from German-Polish relations
                                    with respect to the Polish Corridor, Danzig, and East
                                    Prussia</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg605">Refusal by the United States of invitation by
                                    the League of Nations to participate in a special committee to
                                    study a pact of economic non-aggression</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg607">Proposals for an international conference on
                                    the stabilization of silver</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg632">Participation of the United States in the
                                    Conference of Wheat Exporting Countries, London, May 18–23,
                                    1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg646">Convention between the United States and
                                    other powers for limiting the manufacture and regulating the
                                    distribution of narcotic drugs, concluded at Geneva, July 13,
                                    1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg699">Conference on the Suppression of Opium
                                    Smoking, held at Bangkok, Siam, November 9–27, 1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg706">Refusal of the United States to adhere to the
                                    convention of September 30, 1921, on traffic in women and
                                    children</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg709">Cooperation of the United States with several
                                    other governments in reconnaissance surveys for an
                                    Inter-American Highway</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg715">The Chaco Dispute between Bolivia and
                                    Paraguay</ref></item>
                            <item>Boundary disputes: <list>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg771">Dominican Republic and
                                        Haiti</ref></item>
                                    <item><ref target="#pg792">Honduras and Nicaragua</ref></item>
                                </list></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg808">Representations by foreign governments with
                                    respect to Senate bill relating to payment of advance wages to
                                    seamen on foreign vessels</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg815">Representations by foreign governments
                                    regarding Senate bills for the deportation of certain alien
                                    seamen</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg821">Immunity of foreign states from suits in
                                    Federal and State courts; representation of the United States
                                    before foreign courts</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg823">Diplomatic immunity of a foreign commercial
                                    attaché in the United States</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Afghanistan</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg825">Disinclination of the United States to
                                    establish official relations with the Government of
                                    Afghanistan</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albania</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg827">Unperfected treaty of naturalization between
                                    the United States and Albania, signed January 21,
                                1931</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Australia</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg839">Proposed treaty between the United States and
                                    Australia relating to rights of entry for
                                businessmen</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg843">Policy in regard to American citizens abroad
                                    joining associations engaged in subversive activities in foreign
                                    countries</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Austria</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg847">Ratification of commercial treaty of June 19,
                                    1928, between the United States and Austria, with supplementary
                                    agreement signed January 20, 1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg866">Opposition in Austria to the showing of the
                                    motion picture “All Quiet on the Western Front”</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bolivia</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg874">Representations to Bolivia against the
                                    imposition of a tax upon diplomatic telegrams</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <pb facs="0011" n="VII" xml:id="pgVII"/>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Brazil</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg876">Representations against Brazilian decree
                                    establishing a discount of 50 percent on consular fees to
                                    shippers by the Lloyd Brasileiro Navigation Company</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg883">Inability of the United States to sell
                                    warships to Brazil because of treaty restrictions</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bulgaria</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg886">Representations on behalf of Standard Oil
                                    interests in Bulgaria with respect to government action fixing
                                    the price of kerosene</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg892">Project for improvement of the St. Lawrence
                                    Waterway by joint action of the United States and
                                Canada</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg894">Representations by Canada against changes in
                                    border crossing privileges between Canada and the United
                                    States</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg898">Immunity of consular officers and employees
                                    from testifying as to official acts and producing official
                                    records</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chile</hi>: <list>
                            <item><ref target="#pg901">Revolution in Chile</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg919">Provisional commercial agreement between the
                                    United States and Chile effected by exchange of notes, signed
                                    September 28, 1931</ref></item>
                            <item><ref target="#pg928">Representations against holding of an
                                    American citizen incommunicado following arrest</ref></item>
                        </list></item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
